# TiO2 for PVC Profiles & Window Frames

Window frames, fence boards, siding — UV-stable rutile to prevent yellowing and chalking over 10+ years outdoor.

PVC profiles — window frames, fencing, siding, exterior trim, decking — represent one of the most demanding TiO2 applications in plastics. The PVC compound must perform outdoors for 10–25 years without yellowing, chalking, embrittlement, or warpage. TiO2 selection is critical because PVC is particularly susceptible to photochemical degradation, and the TiO2 surface treatment must protect both itself and the PVC polymer.

SEMITI 2160 (Kronos 2160 equivalent) is the workhorse grade for outdoor PVC. SEMITI 2190 is positioned for premium 20-year warranty applications. SEMITI 996 is acceptable for short-service (3–5 year) applications and interior PVC.

